@*
    Lightweight inline SVG approximation of the reference illustration:
    a student reading on a stack of books, with a bookshelf, wall clock and
    plant behind. Sized 386 x 236 to match the reference proportions.

    To swap in real artwork later, replace the whole <svg> below with e.g.
        <img src="~/img/library-illustration.svg" alt="" class="w-full" />
*@
<svg class="block h-auto w-full" viewBox="0 0 386 236" fill="none"
     xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">

    <!-- ---------- background accents ---------- -->
